{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24248","headline":"和韦庶子远坊赴宴未夜先归之作兼呈裴员外 · 白居易","name":"和韦庶子远坊赴宴未夜先归之作兼呈裴员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促席留欢日未曛，远坊归思已纷纷。\n无妨按辔行乘月，何必逃杯走似云。\n银烛忍抛杨柳曲，金鞍潜送石榴裙。\n到时常晚归时早，笑乐三分校一分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}